 <head>
  <title>EX-99.1</title>
 </head>
 <body style="margin: auto!important;padding: 8px;">
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Exhibit 99.1</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:16pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:16pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Virax Biolabs Group Limited</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;min-width:fit-content;">(Incorporated in the Cayman Islands with limited liability)</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Notice of 2023 Annual General Meeting of Shareholders</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">To Be Held on December 6, 2023, at 2:00 p.m., local time</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN THAT </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">the annual general meeting (the &#x201c;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Meeting</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201d; or &#x201c;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">AGM</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201d;) of holders of ordinary shares (the &#x201c;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Ordinary Shares</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201d;) (the &#x201c;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">shareholders</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201d;) of Virax Biolabs Group Limited (the &#x201c;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Company</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201d;) will be held at BioCity Glasgow, Bo&#x2019;Ness Road, Newhouse, Lanarkshire, ML1 5UH, on December 6, 2023, at 2:00 p.m., local time. Eligible shareholders, directors, as well as duly appointed proxyholders will be able to attend, participate and vote at the Meeting.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">  </font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">The purpose of the Meeting is as follows:</font></p>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p>
  <table style="border-spacing:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100.0%;border-collapse:separate;">
   <tr style="visibility:collapse;">
    <td style="width:4%;"></td>
    <td style="width:96%;"></td>
   </tr>
   <tr style="height:10pt;">
    <td style="padding-top:0.01in;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">1.</font></p></td>
    <td style="padding-top:0.01in;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">RESOLVED as an ordinary resolution: to ratify and approve the appointment of Reliant CPAs PC as auditor of the Company for the fiscal year ending March 31, 2024, and to authorize the board of directors of the Company to fix the remuneration of the auditor (the &#x201c;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Auditor Proposal</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201d;);</font></p></td>
   </tr>
  </table>
  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p>
  <table style="border-spacing:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100.0%;border-collapse:separate;">
   <tr style="visibility:collapse;">
    <td style="width:4%;"></td>
    <td style="width:96%;"></td>
   </tr>
   <tr style="height:10pt;">
    <td style="padding-top:0.01in;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">2.</font></p></td>
    <td style="padding-top:0.01in;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">RESOLVED as an ordinary resolution: to elect the following persons as Directors of the Company, pursuant to the Company&#x2019;s Articles of Association (the &#x201c;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Election Proposa</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">l&#x201d;);</font></p></td>
   </tr>
  </table>
