    <td style="padding-top:0.01in;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">Mark Ternouth be re-elected as a director of the Company to hold office until the next annual general meeting or until his successors are duly elected and qualified, subject to earlier death, resignation, or removal;</font></p></td>
